xref:assignop_as_binop[The binary operator corresponding to ``assignop``]

. If ``assignop`` matches pattern ``{apos}{plus}={apos}``: return ``{apos}{plus}{apos}``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+'-='+``: return ``+'-'+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``{apos}|{plus}|={apos}``: return ``{apos}|{plus}|{apos}``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+'|-|='+``: return ``+'|-|'+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+'*='+``: return ``+'*'+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+'/='+``: return ``+'/'+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+'%='+``: return ``+'%'+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+'<<='+``: return ``+'<<'+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+'>>='+``: return ``+'>>'+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+'&='+``: return ``+'&'+``.
. Else if ``assignop`` matches pattern ``+'^='+``: return ``+'^'+``.
. Else: return ``+'|'+``.

. +++<span id="assignop_as_binop-else"></span>+++Otherwise: return ``·``.

