   .... Let ``b~h~^{asterisk}^`` be ``b^{asterisk}^[0`` ``:`` ``w]``.
   .... Let ``i'`` be ``the`` ``length`` ``of`` ``b^{asterisk}^`` ``-`` ``w``.
