xref:lift_nameIR_as_nonTypeName[$lift_nameIR_as_nonTypeName(t)]

. If ``t`` is equal to ``"apply"``: return ``+APPLY+``.
. Else if ``t`` is equal to ``"key"``: return ``+KEY+``.
. Else if ``t`` is equal to ``"actions"``: return ``+ACTIONS+``.
. Else if ``t`` is equal to ``"state"``: return ``+STATE+``.
. Else if ``t`` is equal to ``"entries"``: return ``+ENTRIES+``.
. Else if ``t`` is equal to ``"type"``: return ``+TYPE+``.
. Else: return ``+PRIORITY+``.

