 .. If ``direction'^{asterisk}^`` matches pattern ``[]``: return ``true``.
 .. Else:
  ... Let ``direction~h~`` ``{two-colons}`` ``direction~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``direction'^{asterisk}^``.
  ... Check that ``direction~h~`` does not match pattern ``{nbsp}~EMPTY~``.
