. +++<span class="bk-arm-anchor" id="bk-directionless_trailing'-1-arm-2"></span>+++Then, try:
 .. If ``b`` is equal to ``true``:
  ... Let!~type~ ``direction`` ``{two-colons}`` ``direction~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``direction'^{asterisk}^``.+++<sub class="bk-mark">[FAIL]</sub>+++
  ... Check that ``direction`` is ``{nbsp}~EMPTY~``.
  ... Return xref:directionless_trailing'[``$directionless_trailing'(true,`` ``direction~t~^{asterisk}^)``].+++<sub class="bk-mark">[FAIL]</sub>+++
 .. Else:
  ... Let!~type~ ``direction`` ``{two-colons}`` ``direction~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``direction'^{asterisk}^``.+++<sub class="bk-mark">[FAIL]</sub>+++
  ... Check that ``direction`` is ``{nbsp}~EMPTY~``.
  ... Return ``false``.

