xref:ExternFunctionCall_eval_lctk[ExternFunctionCall_eval_lctk]:

* Calling an extern function ``nameIR``(``nameIR'^{asterisk}^``) under context ``TC``:
* The result is ``value``.

xref:Expr_eval_lctk[Expr_eval_lctk]:

* Local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``:
* The result is ``value``.

xref:Expr_eval_lctk[Local compile-time evaluation of ``expressionIR`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``]:

. If let ``booleanLiteral`` be ``expressionIR``:
 .. Let ``boolValue`` be xref:ite[``{nbsp}~B~`` ``true`` if ``booleanLiteral`` is equal to ``+TRUE+`` otherwise ``{nbsp}~B~`` ``false``].+++<sub class="bk-mark">[<a href="#Expr_eval_lctk-referenceExpressionIR">→ referenceExpressionIR</a>]</sub>+++
 .. The result is ``boolValue``.
. Else if let ``integerLiteral`` be ``expressionIR``: the result is ``integerLiteral``.
. Else if let ``stringLiteral`` be ``expressionIR``: the result is ``stringLiteral``.

xref:Expr_eval_lctk[Local compile-time evaluation of ``prefixedNameIR`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``]:

. Let ``value`` be xref:find_var_value_t[the value of variable ``prefixedNameIR`` from the ``p`` layer of ``TC``].+++<sub class="bk-mark">[<a href="#Expr_eval_lctk-errorAccessExpressionIR">→ errorAccessExpressionIR</a>]</sub>+++
. The result is ``value``.

xref:Expr_eval_lctk[Local compile-time evaluation of ``+'...'+`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``]:
 the result is ``+DEFAULT+``.

xref:Expr_eval_lctk[Local compile-time evaluation of ``unop`` ``typedExpressionIR`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``]:

. Let ``value`` be the result of xref:Expr_eval_lctk[local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``].
. The result is xref:un_op[``unop`` ``value``].+++<sub class="bk-mark">[<a href="#Expr_eval_lctk-errorAccessExpressionIR">→ errorAccessExpressionIR</a>]</sub>+++

xref:Expr_eval_lctk[Local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~l~`` ``binop`` ``typedExpressionIR~r~`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``]:

. +++<span class="bk-arm-anchor" id="bk-Expr_eval_lctk-2-arm-1"></span>+++Try:
 .. Check that ``binop`` is not in ``+[+`` ``+'&&'+,`` ``+'||'+`` ``+]+``.
 .. Let ``value~l~`` be the result of xref:Expr_eval_lctk[local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~l~``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``].
 .. Let ``value~r~`` be the result of xref:Expr_eval_lctk[local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~r~``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``].
 .. The result is xref:bin_op[``value~l~`` ``binop`` ``value~r~``].+++<sub class="bk-mark">[<a href="#bk-Expr_eval_lctk-2-arm-2">→ 2</a>]</sub>+++
. +++<span class="bk-arm-anchor" id="bk-Expr_eval_lctk-2-arm-2"></span>+++Then, try:
 .. If ``binop`` matches pattern ``+'&&'+``:
  ... Let ``value`` be the result of xref:Expr_eval_lctk[local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~l~``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``].
  ... If ``value`` is equal to ``{nbsp}~B~`` ``false``: the result is ``{nbsp}~B~`` ``false``.
  ... Else if ``value`` is equal to ``{nbsp}~B~`` ``true``:
   .... Let ``value~r~`` be the result of xref:Expr_eval_lctk[local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~r~``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``].
   .... The result is ``value~r~``.
 .. Else if ``binop`` matches pattern ``+'||'+``:
  ... Let ``value`` be the result of xref:Expr_eval_lctk[local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~l~``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``].
  ... If ``value`` is equal to ``{nbsp}~B~`` ``true``: the result is ``{nbsp}~B~`` ``true``.
  ... Else if ``value`` is equal to ``{nbsp}~B~`` ``false``:
   .... Let ``value~r~`` be the result of xref:Expr_eval_lctk[local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~r~``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``].
   .... The result is ``value~r~``.

xref:Expr_eval_lctk[Local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~cond~`` ``+'?'+`` ``typedExpressionIR~true~`` ``+':'+`` ``typedExpressionIR~false~`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under context ``TC`` at ``p``]:

