xref:cast_binary[``typedExpressionIR~l~`` and ``typedExpressionIR~r~`` implicitly cast to equal types]

. Let xref:expressionNoteIR[a pair of type ``typeIR~l~`` and compile-time known-ness ``++_++``] be the note of ``typedExpressionIR~l~``.
. Let xref:expressionNoteIR[a pair of type ``typeIR~r~`` and compile-time known-ness ``++_++``] be the note of ``typedExpressionIR~r~``.
