. If let ``+OK+`` ``typeIR~cast~^{asterisk}^`` be ``castResult``:
 .. Let ``typedExpressionIR~l_cast~`` be xref:apply_cast[``typedExpressionIR~l~`` cast through ``typeIR~cast~^{asterisk}^``].+++<sub class="bk-mark">[<a href="#cast_binary-else">→ ⋅</a>]</sub>+++
