 .. Let casts ``castResult'`` be the result of xref:Cast_impl[checking if ``typeIR~r~`` can be implicitly cast to ``typeIR~l~``].
 .. If let ``+OK+`` ``typeIR~cast~^{asterisk}^`` be ``castResult'``:
  ... Let ``typedExpressionIR~r_cast~`` be xref:apply_cast[``typedExpressionIR~r~`` cast through ``typeIR~cast~^{asterisk}^``].+++<sub class="bk-mark">[<a href="#cast_binary-else">→ ⋅</a>]</sub>+++
