   .... Return xref:cast_binary[``typedExpressionIR~l_cast~`` and ``typedExpressionIR~r~`` implicitly cast to equal types].+++<sub class="bk-mark">[<a href="#bk-cast_binary-1-arm-2">→ iii</a>]</sub>+++
  ... +++<span class="bk-arm-anchor" id="bk-cast_binary-1-arm-2"></span>+++Then, try:
   .... Check that ``typedExpressionIR~l~`` is equal to ``typedExpressionIR~l_cast~``.
