  ... If let ``+INT+`` ``+`<+`` ``w~b~`` ``+`>+`` be ``typeIR'``:
   .... Return ``+INT+`` ``+`<+`` ``w~a~`` ``{plus}`` ``w~b~`` ``+`>+``.
  ... Else if let ``+BIT+`` ``+`<+`` ``w~b~`` ``+`>+`` be ``typeIR'``:
   .... Return ``+INT+`` ``+`<+`` ``w~a~`` ``{plus}`` ``w~b~`` ``+`>+``.
 .. Else if let ``+BIT+`` ``+`<+`` ``w~a~`` ``+`>+`` be ``typeIR``:
  ... If let ``+INT+`` ``+`<+`` ``w~b~`` ``+`>+`` be ``typeIR'``:
   .... Return ``+BIT+`` ``+`<+`` ``w~a~`` ``{plus}`` ``w~b~`` ``+`>+``.
  ... Else if let ``+BIT+`` ``+`<+`` ``w~b~`` ``+`>+`` be ``typeIR'``:
   .... Return ``+BIT+`` ``+`<+`` ``w~a~`` ``{plus}`` ``w~b~`` ``+`>+``.
 .. Else if let ``+TYPEDEF+`` ``++_++`` ``typeIR~l~`` be ``typeIR``:
  ... Return xref:result_concat[``$result_concat(typeIR~l~,`` ``typeIR')``].+++<sub class="bk-mark">[<a href="#bk-result_concat-1-arm-2">→ 2</a>]</sub>+++
. +++<span class="bk-arm-anchor" id="bk-result_concat-1-arm-2"></span>+++Then, try:
