. If ``typeIR`` does not have type ``externObjectTypeIR``: return ``true``.
. Else:
 .. Let ``+EXTERN+`` ``++_++`` ``+`<+`` ``++_++^{asterisk}^`` ``+`>+`` ``+`{+`` ``(`` ``++_++`` ``+':'+`` ``externMethodTypeDefIR`` ``)^{asterisk}^`` ``+`}+`` be ``typeIR``.
