. Check that ``externMethodTypeDefIR`` matches pattern ``+EXTERN_METHOD+`` ``%`` ``+`<+`` ``%`` ``+','+`` ``%`` ``+`>+`` ``+`(+`` ``%`` ``+`)+`` ``+':'+`` ``%``.
