xref:instantiable_extern[$instantiable_extern(p, TC, instctxt)]

. If ``p`` matches pattern ``+GLOBAL+``: return ``true``.
. Else if ``p`` matches pattern ``+BLOCK+``: return ``true``.
. Else: return ``true``.

xref:instantiable_parser[$instantiable_parser(p, TC, instctxt)]

. If ``p`` matches pattern ``+GLOBAL+``: return ``instctxt`` is equal to ``+ANON+``.
. Else if ``p`` matches pattern ``+BLOCK+``:
 .. Let ``blockKind`` be ``TC.+BLOCK+.+KIND+``.
 .. Return ``blockKind`` is equal to ``+PARSER+`` or ``blockKind`` is equal to ``+PACKAGE+``.
. Else:
 .. Let ``localKind`` be ``TC.+LOCAL+.+KIND+``.
 .. Return ``localKind`` is equal to ``+PARSER_STATE+``.

xref:instantiable_control[$instantiable_control(p, TC, instctxt)]

. If ``p`` matches pattern ``+GLOBAL+``: return ``instctxt`` is equal to ``+ANON+``.
. Else if ``p`` matches pattern ``+BLOCK+``:
 .. Let ``blockKind`` be ``TC.+BLOCK+.+KIND+``.
 .. Return ``blockKind`` is equal to ``+CONTROL+`` or ``blockKind`` is equal to ``+PACKAGE+``.
. Else:
 .. Let ``localKind`` be ``TC.+LOCAL+.+KIND+``.
 .. Return ``localKind`` is equal to ``+CONTROL_APPLY_METHOD+``.

xref:instantiable_package[$instantiable_package(p, TC, instctxt)]

. If ``p`` matches pattern ``+GLOBAL+``: return ``true``.
. Else if ``p`` matches pattern ``+BLOCK+``:
 .. Let ``blockKind`` be ``TC.+BLOCK+.+KIND+``.
 .. Return ``blockKind`` is equal to ``+PACKAGE+``.
. Else: return ``false``.

xref:instantiable_table[$instantiable_table(p, TC, instctxt)]

. If ``p`` matches pattern ``+GLOBAL+``: return ``false``.
. Else if ``p`` matches pattern ``+BLOCK+``:
 .. Let ``blockKind`` be ``TC.+BLOCK+.+KIND+``.
 .. Return ``blockKind`` is equal to ``+CONTROL+``.
. Else: return ``false``.

